            "notes": "round one is incredibly simple!\n\nfor powers, grab [Pinpoint Prescription](item_5cfa07d8-7b5d-42df-a9a8-c6a580acb8bc). \n\nfor items, grab:\n[Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0)\n[Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) \n[Ammo Reserves](item_982d53aa-5ef4-493f-93e7-9e374d0ebf34)\n(if you feel like you're not confident on your survival, grab either [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da) or [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6).\n\nwhat i like to do during this round is just spam unscoped shots into both my own team and the enemy team. i also like shooting at the flyers, just to help my team out a bit.",
