            "created_at": "2025-08-29T04:58:24.294276+00:00",
            "notes": "for this round, the power i like to grab is [Sleep Regimen](item_28934e4f-0668-482e-b10d-a5d557cc3b1e).\nyou get more health, and it helps with your survivability greatly. also do note that any sleeps you got in round 1 also adds towards your health pool, making you, again, more tanky.\n\nyou'll be getting your two most important items this round, [Tranquilizer](item_2bea20a0-21c0-4a52-b81e-596c17d184b4) and [Potent Projectiles](item_7e9a8017-9458-4318-aea9-5e80ba7e3c46). tranquilizer will help so much more with hitting sleeps and this is where you can really start assassinating people. potent projectiles just helps with hitting shots, lol.\n\ni like to lean more towards attack speed early since it'll help you get more money and overall do more damage/healing. weapon power is also good, but i do love the LMG ana build i can't lie.",
