            "created_at": "2025-08-29T04:58:24.294276+00:00",
            "notes": "honestly, past round 3 is just get STRONGER. i like to keep attack speed around 25-30 here, and then start getting weapon power up here. you can really start almost one shotting flankers here (as long as theyre buffing anything but health) but the classic nade, HEADSHOT, punch combo is nearly essential for these assassination attempts. (i had a lucio diving me all game and i won the 1v1 almost every time because i saved sleep for him) if you're not getting dove, you can run up to their DPS or supports and just delete them most of the time. if the enemy has a [Kiriko](hero_70a0ac5c-2a55-4fab-beeb-2f570886426f), you will likely not be able to kill them following the combo. classic ana counter. [Zarya](hero_be6cc516-0b7a-4515-8472-f489f08993b0) and [Winston](hero_a0ebe5ef-69a6-4a8f-9360-7b7fed8bce88) may also cause problems at this stage.",
